sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant Nginx as Nginx LB
    participant ASR as ASR Pool
    participant Orch as LangGraph Orchestrator
    participant RAG as Knowledge / RAG
    participant CRM as CRM & Ticketing
    participant LLM as LLM Pool
    participant TTS as TTS Pool

    Caller->>Nginx: Audio in
    Nginx->>ASR: Route to available worker
    ASR->>Orch: Transcript + confidence
    Orch->>Orch: Intent detection
    alt Needs knowledge
        Orch->>RAG: Retrieve evidence
        RAG-->>Orch: Grounded context
    end
    alt Needs business action
        Orch->>CRM: Tool call (ticket / CRM)
        CRM-->>Orch: Action result
    end
    Orch->>LLM: Compose response
    LLM-->>Orch: Response text
    Orch->>TTS: Synthesize speech
    TTS->>Nginx: Audio out
    Nginx-->>Caller: Voice response
